{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_title", "source_sha256": "b47ae52dfd37844ff856e7f983e1cf7c2e1ea4cc7a3eaf0e3971a68db3d48eed", "ja": "きっと、どこまでも！", "zh": "一定能展翅高飞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_synopsis", "source_sha256": "af99959ceaccb83f0b8b392a7b427a1a97f85d1250a55914eed172c103928509", "ja": "次回のセンターに決まった麗花に翻弄される\n助っ人の瑞希、茜、紬。紬は自分の未熟さか\nら助っ人を辞退するが、そんな紬と一緒だか\nら自分は自由にできると気持ち伝えた麗花は\n公演で歌声を翼に、空へ羽ばたくのだった。", "zh": "预定担任下次公演Center的丽花，\n将帮手瑞希、茜、䌷搞得天旋地转。\n䌷认为自己不够成熟而想推辞帮手，\n但丽花表示就是因为有䌷，她才能自由自在，\n并在公演上将歌声化为羽翼，展翅飞向天空。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1000_p", "source_sha256": "12378f1a38abfbc65cd1e72e10634bbc5d6f040e5d5ac46203491fa21a7b4382", "ja": "（麗花の自由な歌声は、劇場中のお客さんに……\nいや、劇場の外にまで届いたかもしれないな！）", "zh": "（丽花自由的歌声传到剧场里每一位观众耳中……\n不，也许连剧场外都能听到！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "ae363bc539c2d8b2c4bbfef5f1666462477a29dedf5b877df7e2fae11f3b4371", "ja": "ただいま～！\nあー、楽しかった♪", "zh": "我回来了～！\n哇──真开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f06a8f0492ff8e0150093a7761c68d28188f6fc9ba52043706d26351c6e88708", "ja": "麗花、お疲れさま。\nいいステージだったよ。", "zh": "丽花，辛苦你了。\n表演很棒喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "a2eb9efb96cb1b19979d03bd56f62a2c1ed2ff11d212eb5f11ccc57439dcb1f1", "ja": "はい！　{$P$}さんも、\nお疲れさまでした！", "zh": "谢谢！{$P$}先生，\n你也辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "187bf5e49c2e08f85696e0edda7cc49a2b403cdf93ae0007d4b006fd960ff21f", "ja": "茜ちゃん、瑞希ちゃん、紬ちゃん、お疲れさま！\n助っ人、とっても頼もしかったよ♪", "zh": "小茜、小瑞希、小䌷，你们都辛苦了！\n帮手们很可靠喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "b620aea4bceb5ce460b0a8cc1a6c07dbb4349612d17107fb03aa20cedd36cc80", "ja": "おかげで、何も考えず、とっても自由に歌えました！\nみんなに拍手ー♪　ぱちぱちぱち～♪", "zh": "因为有你们，我才能什么都不思考，自由唱歌！\n为大家拍拍手──♪啪啪啪～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8d061e5bac7a49923d87f7d6149c4ba454aeb638a2c807b118572bdfc698fafc", "ja": "ありがとうございます。少しでも北上さんの\n足場になれたのでしたら、私も本望です。", "zh": "谢谢夸奖。\n希望多少有为北上提供立足之地，如此我就满意了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "92f0d0107bc353db8682969a46e1350a6b17dec753ed670ebcd5df86cd3024c1", "ja": "でも、逆に麗花ちゃんが、\n何か考えながら歌うことなんて、あったっけ？", "zh": "不过，小茜倒是想问小丽花，\n你以往唱歌时有思考过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "f4fa6c1210d2596824dd9438b320708686c29217f5247d1bd3b37f8362dd931d", "ja": "ええっ、それくらいあるよ？　晩ごはんのこととか、\n次はどんな山に登ろうかな～とかとか♪", "zh": "什么？当然有啰！\n像是晚餐要吃什么、下次要登哪座山～之类的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b13f4e4ae3265cebbba71d1dabacbdfb75c7a8d2487fff528e3b1d6060dc96db", "ja": "って、いつもそんなこと考えながら歌ってるのか？", "zh": "等等，你平时唱歌都在想这些事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "12ffb4e7f308fbb494cae936a9656f580b7705d6e68b551df020d0e0398b52df", "ja": "そう返すとは……勉強になるぞ。\n……心にメモしておこう。", "zh": "没想到能这样回答……受教了。\n……我要在心里做笔记。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b125164248bb5e18edee381890f46147f444a6e19a668825f47ce0d921ef67ce", "ja": "同じステージで北上さんの歌を聞いていて、心が\n踊りました。北上さんは、いつも自由奔放ですが……。", "zh": "在同个舞台上听到北上的歌声，让我的内心十分雀跃。\n北上平时虽然自由奔放……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b9e2929328cb4b22c372858e0791770e6973dbc1d40a6d341b3562938cf4f2a5", "ja": "ステージの上で歌う姿は、本当に\nどこまでも飛んでいけそうに見えて……素敵でした。", "zh": "但在舞台上演唱时，\n看起来好像真的能翱翔天际……非常动人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "6a2a740a8fea63097fd5fa949054ca19d50e1eedd2dd2f41f4610e4fd8b3fd55", "ja": "ふふっ。紬ちゃんが見守ってくれたおかげだよ！\nありがとうの、ぎゅー！", "zh": "呵呵，那都是因为有小䌷从旁支持我喔！\n谢谢你，抱一个──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "756046a51cf96bccfaf2b8a2891cf3044c4453586827d1f784ae59bca008577b", "ja": "こ、ここでハグは……\nあの、衣装が引っかかってしまいますっ。", "zh": "请、请别在这里拥抱……\n那个、会拉扯到服装的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "3658553cb9008221fc56082ac5102ba7b76136dca91cb16afaeceb05dc1485f0", "ja": "あっ、そっか。\nじゃあ、ガマンするね。また後で♪", "zh": "啊，对喔！\n那我先忍耐，待会再抱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7208b6b7edb7cc6af8a167bc2af90c40fd082169471ff126389d1f383619e2ae", "ja": "は、はい、また後で……。後で？", "zh": "好、好的，待会再抱……待会？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1017_p", "source_sha256": "87c8159ef4f19bdf31b0f2d3ce74d309250e1d039e2ffd89b1bf3ece5b7feab2", "ja": "紬の言う通り、のびのびとしたいいステージだった。\nみんな、本当にお疲れさま！", "zh": "䌷说得对，这是场轻松自在的表演。\n真的辛苦大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1018_p", "source_sha256": "40f71033f0b061f3daf3502ad3c193a3ce01889a7759a7caaeb0dea2c5ac9d18", "ja": "名残惜しいけど……ん？", "zh": "虽然依依不舍……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1019_se", "source_sha256": "fd62ed9d0898007b94b31f8bb921ed1cfa3949e130f1da878dadb783003e73bc", "ja": "（アンコール！　アンコール！）", "zh": "（安可！安可！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "b573f247c6dfac95f7703660674217b34359a6d7989abd4b6fb59f4d431f5157", "ja": "わあっ、アンコールですね♪\n私、さっそく行ってきます！", "zh": "哇！是安可呢♪\n我马上过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2f08ffce322446093dea52092f0db4c82b16264169b2292d51085dee77b9e11a", "ja": "えっ、北上さん！？\n……本当に、さっそく行ってしまいました……。", "zh": "咦？北上！？\n……她真的马上过去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1022_se", "source_sha256": "e11e9f81ff0ca252458f3433e6b4755ebcd12acd00784829212b3d039deab536", "ja": "（ワアアアアアアッ！）", "zh": "（哗啊啊啊啊啊啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1023_p", "source_sha256": "144d2ae0e19cb641e3525cab7e0308f614a457a505dc3be000cff4ab7a7352ed", "ja": "そして、さっそく盛り上げてるな……！", "zh": "然后，观众也马上嗨起来了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "d5a43effe42fb023c7614fac68ab4e3ed8442e262e84d3565a44cdea4b473fa9", "ja": "もう一度やる元気があるとは、北上さんの体力は\n無尽蔵ですね。……さすが私のライバル。", "zh": "想不到北上还有活力再上场，\n她的体力真是无穷无尽……不愧是我的劲敌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "28a1f97beca86b794a18a001d2a8f7185b1fbad08ff37b1e1476429c4bfcf5b6", "ja": "みんなー、早く早くー！\nお客さんたち、やる気満々だよー！", "zh": "大家──快点快点──！\n观众都迫不及待啰──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1026_se", "source_sha256": "e11e9f81ff0ca252458f3433e6b4755ebcd12acd00784829212b3d039deab536", "ja": "（ワアアアアアアッ！）", "zh": "（哗啊啊啊啊啊啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "2db52311561efccd46b164834e304db686a8e2d74392c7f95804801a2e84123f", "ja": "えへへ……こうなったら、最後までつきあうしか\nなさそうだね。茜ちゃんに不可能はないのだ！", "zh": "嘿嘿……看来也只能奉陪到底了。\n小茜的字典里没有「不可能」这个词！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1028_044miz", "source_sha256": "0789f747ed06c00b667aa38bef1f1ddf78d66b294e46bcf035adb7fc5ec8d02f", "ja": "では{$P$}、行ってきます。\n……アイルビーバック。", "zh": "那么{$P$}，我也要过去了。\n……I'll be back。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1029_051tmg", "source_sha256": "699f2199e3e92c7c183581ff5b63cda7cdc91a13ff952eee08cd02fa651e9a56", "ja": "み、みなさん！？　……もう、こうなったら私も\nとことんお付き合いして参ります。", "zh": "各、各位！？真是的，既然如此，\n我也只能与各位同进退了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1030_p", "source_sha256": "5e9e27075f146ddd52e4dcf6e92fd78e584f363f872efe14e3b251b1d73a6d31", "ja": "ああ、行ってこい！", "zh": "好，去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1031_p", "source_sha256": "3ef403b0adc170d6cd896f5e4e8d0c73607d720c134ac19e4731c2d13c46f655", "ja": "（麗花の声に促されるまま、みんなが\nステージへと駆けていく。……いい表情だな）", "zh": "（在丽花催促之下，\n大家纷纷冲回舞台……脸上的表情都很棒。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_029_1032_p", "source_sha256": "e2373a37d17980675e8fed065a9d2dd1dee93e2e27ab66434fa8e8dbd139e200", "ja": "（今日のステージをきっかけに、麗花はこれからも、\n更に高く飛ぶ姿をファンに見せてくれるだろう！）", "zh": "（经过今天的演出，\n丽花以后应该能让粉丝看到她飞往更高处的模样！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
